  "recorded": "The case passed 10 runs against the unchanged original with Node.js 26.12.1 and @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.27.1, run as node src/index.ts, the file npm start runs with type stripping. The template registers nothing and never calls the legacy API, so it needs no service. The SDK answers every listing and the tool call with Method not found, code -32601, and the case also accepts the empty listings and the unknown tool answers other SDKs give.",
